    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Distinguishing obligation and recommendation",
     "texto": [
      "**Må** usually signals an obligation; **bør**, a recommendation. **Må ikke** prohibits an action. In a passive notice, **verneutstyr må brukes** means protective equipment must be used. Identify exceptions and whom they apply to."
     ],
